---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Recipes
description: Recipes from the kitchen, for friends and family.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- The Recipes landing page. It lists every published recipe automatically:
    add a recipe file and it appears here, no editing needed. -#}
<section class="container page-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">The kitchen shelf</p>
  <h1>Recipes</h1>
  <p class="lead">[Placeholder: a sentence or two introducing the recipes.]</p>
</section>

<section class="container page-section">
  {% set recipes = collections.recipe | sort(false, false, "data.title") %}
  {% if recipes | length %}
  <ul class="card-grid recipe-cards">
    {% for recipe in recipes %}
    <li>
      <a class="card" href="{{ recipe.url }}">
        <h2 class="card__title">{{ recipe.data.title }}</h2>
        {% if recipe.data.draft %}<span class="chip chip--new">Draft</span>{% endif %}
        <p>{{ "Makes" if recipe.data.makes.verb == "makes" else "Serves" }} {{ recipe.data.makes.amount }} {{ recipe.data.makes.unit }}</p>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <p>Recipes are on their way. Quill is still taste-testing.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
